---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="GC Fitness — Support">
  <main class="legal-page">
    <div class="legal-container">
      <p class="legal-lang"><a href="/gc-fitness/support">Versión en español</a></p>
      <h1>Support — GC Fitness</h1>

      <p>
        Need help with GC Fitness? Email us at
        <a href="mailto:support@goldencrowvs.com">support@goldencrowvs.com</a>. We reply as soon as
        we can, and reports about content or people are reviewed within 24 hours.
      </p>

      <h2>Reporting content or a person</h2>
      <p>
        GC Fitness has zero tolerance for objectionable content and abusive users. From the app
        you can report a <strong>profile</strong>, a <strong>published routine</strong>, a
        <strong>comment</strong>, or a <strong>message</strong>:
      </p>
      <ol>
        <li>Open the content's menu (for a message, long-press it) and tap
          <strong>Report</strong>.</li>
        <li>Pick a reason: spam, harassment or bullying, sexual content, violence or dangerous
          content, impersonation, or something else. You can add a note.</li>
        <li>Tap <strong>Send</strong>.</li>
      </ol>
      <p>
        We review every report within 24 hours. If the content breaches the
        <a href="/en/gc-fitness/terms">Terms of Use</a>, we hide it, and we may suspend or close the
        account that published it. <strong>We never tell anyone who reported them.</strong>
      </p>
      <p>
        You can also report by email at
        <a href="mailto:support@goldencrowvs.com?subject=GC%20Fitness%20report">support@goldencrowvs.com</a>
        with the person's @handle or the routine's link.
      </p>

      <h2>Blocking someone</h2>
      <p>
        From a person's profile or from a conversation, tap <strong>Block</strong>. A blocked person
        can't see your profile or your routines, or message you, and you both stop following each
        other. They are not notified. To unblock, go to <strong>Settings → Blocked
        accounts</strong>.
      </p>

      <h2>If you are in danger</h2>
      <p>
        If someone threatens you or you are at risk, contact your local emergency services first.
        Then report it in the app so we can act on the account.
      </p>

      <h2>Account and subscriptions</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Deleting your account:</strong> see
          <a href="/en/gc-fitness/delete-account">Account deletion</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Cancelling or managing Premium:</strong> subscriptions are managed from the
          store — on iOS, <em>Settings → your name → Subscriptions</em>; on Android,
          <em>Google Play → Payments &amp; subscriptions</em>. Refunds are handled by Apple or
          Google.</li>
        <li><strong>Privacy:</strong> see the <a href="/en/gc-fitness/privacy">Privacy
          Policy</a>.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Golden Crow — <a href="mailto:support@goldencrowvs.com">support@goldencrowvs.com</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding: 7rem 1.5rem 4rem;
    min-height: 60vh;
  }
  .legal-container {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .legal-container h1 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .legal-container h2 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin: 2rem 0 0.5rem;
  }
  .legal-container ul,
  .legal-container ol {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }
  .legal-container li {
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
  .legal-lang {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
</style>
